Subject: [PATCH 2/7] DGEMV: dense decode GEMV with K6/K7 instances
 (EXL3_DGEMV, default off)

Split-K ordinary-launch GEMV for 1..48 rows, ported from the QMesh R5 fork with K 6/7 instances. Off by default: not bit-identical to the vendor path and net neutral on Qwen3.8-Flash-Next.
